357 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 262 0 R
/E (The main objective of BuildMe.lk is to create a complete digital ecosystem that solves all problems related to building a house in Sri Lanka. One of the key goals is to make construction simple for ordinary people who do not have technical knowledge. Many users do not understand engineering terms, material quality, or cost calculations, so the platform will provide clear and easy explanations for everything. Another important objective is to create transparency in pricing by showing real-time material costs, labor charges, and total budget estimates. This will help users avoid being overcharged. The platform also aims to introduce a competitive bidding system where professionals compete to provide the best service at the best price, helping customers save money. Additionally, BuildMe.lk aims to connect all construction-related services into one platform, including architects, lawyers, engineers, workers, suppliers, and transport providers. By doing this, the platform reduces the need to visit multiple places and makes the entire process faster and more efficient. Finally, the project aims to support the Sri Lankan economy by creating job opportunities for workers and helping small businesses grow.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
