487 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 267 0 R
/E (The bidding system is the core feature and biggest innovation of BuildMe.lk. This system works like an open tender process where multiple professionals compete for a project. After a user publishes their project, all registered contractors and service providers receive a notification. They can then submit their bids by offering a price and explaining their services. This creates a competitive environment where professionals try to offer better prices and better quality to win the project. The user can view all bids in a clear format and compare them based on price, ratings, experience, and past work. Instead of choosing only the lowest price, the user can select the best overall option. This system helps reduce construction costs and improves service quality because professionals must compete to win projects. It also increases transparency and trust between customers and service providers.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [16]
>>
endobj
