<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 271 0 R
/E (BuildMe.lk also includes a transport and material system where users can order materials and arrange transportation easily. Many people in Sri Lanka face difficulties when transporting materials like sand, cement, or bricks, especially in rural or mountain areas. The platform allows vehicle owners \(tuk-tuks, Boleros, lorries, trucks\) to register and provide transport services. Users can book these vehicles directly through the app. At the same time, hardware suppliers can list their products, allowing users to compare prices and order materials from one place.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [13]
>>
