/P 273 0 R
/E (BuildMe.lk will generate revenue through multiple methods. Professionals such as contractors, lawyers, and workers must pay a registration fee and an annual subscription fee to use the platform. Customers must purchase tickets to access services like bidding and communication. The platform will also take a small commission from successful deals. In addition, hardware suppliers can pay for advertisements to promote their products. This combination of revenue streams ensures that the business is sustainable and profitable.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [15]
